  1. Supplemental Oxygen during Exercise Training in Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease
     SARA FAGGIAN, FRANCESCA BATTISTA, MARCO VECCHIATO, RICHARD CASABURI, MARGARETA EMTNER, NICOLA BORASI...
     PMC12520020 · Medicine and Science in Sports and Exercise · 2025-11-01
     https://doi.org/10.1249/MSS.0000000000003782
     "This review examines supplemental oxygen's role in COPD exercise training. Supplemental oxygen may benefit specific patients and conditions, particularly with high-intensity training, to enhance exercise tolerance and adaptations."

